        "text": "HTMLView.",
        "style": "font-size:21pt;color:#cc4125;"
      },
      {
        "text": "Please, click here",
        "style": "font-size:21pt;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#6d9eeb;"
      },
      {
        "text": " to fix it.",
        "style": "font-size:21pt;"
      },
      {
        "text": "HTMLView Downsides:Image Resolution will be drastically reduced.Font will be overwritten to Arial.Cells with text may be poorly formatted. Frozen rows will not be frozen. Links will not redirect within the sheet.",
